  "prefLabel": "Saf-Mec 405.01 Types of Reinstatement of Individual Mechanical Licenses and Registration Licenses",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-Mec 405.01 Types of Reinstatement of Individual Mechanical Licenses and Registration Licenses. The board shall reinstate individual mechanical licenses and registration licenses, as follows:\n\n(a) In accordance with the terms of the board's order if the licenses were suspended for disciplinary reasons; or\n\n(b) In accordance with Saf-Mec 403 if the licenses lapsed as a result of non-renewal.\n\nSource. #10848, eff 7-1-15",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-mec400.html"
}
